        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"faq-container\" style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem;\">\n  <details class=\"faq-item\" style=\"background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid #E8DFD5; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #2C2420; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n      <span>📦 How long does shipping take?</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #8B6F4E;\">+</span>\n    </summary>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: #6B5E54; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Orders are processed within 1-2 business days. Standard shipping typically takes 3-7 business days. We offer free shipping on all orders over $75!</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\" style=\"background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid #E8DFD5; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #2C2420; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n      <span>↩️ What is your return &amp; exchange policy?</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #8B6F4E;\">+</span>\n    </summary>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: #6B5E54; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">We offer a 30-day hassle-free return policy on all unworn items with original tags attached. Simply contact our support team or initiate a return through our contact page.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\" style=\"background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid #E8DFD5; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #2C2420; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n      <span>📏 How do I find my size?</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #8B6F4E;\">+</span>\n    </summary>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: #6B5E54; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Each product page includes detailed sizing guides and measurements. If you're between sizes, we generally recommend sizing up for a relaxed fit, or reach out to our team for tailored advice!</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\" style=\"background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid #E8DFD5; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #2C2420; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n      <span>🔒 What payment methods do you accept?</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #8B6F4E;\">+</span>\n    </summary>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: #6B5E54; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">We accept all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Shop Pay, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and PayPal. All transactions are 100% encrypted and secure.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"faq-item\" style=\"background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid #E8DFD5; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #2C2420; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n      <span>💬 How can I track my order?</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #8B6F4E;\">+</span>\n    </summary>\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: #6B5E54; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.9375rem;\">Once your order ships, you will receive an email confirmation with your tracking number and a link to track your package in real-time.</p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
